<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian drones have struck Kurdish opposition bases in Sulaymaniyah, Erbil and northern Iraq, causing no casualties but prompting heightened security alerts. Iraqi security forces have arrested high-value ISIS suspects in Kirkuk and captured a notorious ISIS gang member, while also foiling petroleum-product smuggling in territorial waters. Political arrests continue with the former Mosul Sports Club president jailed for embezzlement and a Najaf council member jailed for defamation. Tensions in Basra expose growing security risks for Iraq and Kuwait. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOakJaTWdvOFc2d2ppZGZNUjZoLThmdjdRSGhfVHcteE04MnBfc0VneWVoQkctZVN5c1JScWFkV2l6Vk45TG9HS2ZaM2V0N085MlkyYmVLc1RBbEplSElJcjZyY0VMaXdwSm44Z2NBeXRXb0JmaW5BczFhZGRWWmsyVmZuX1gtTjA3bURHd1JybjFYV0k?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPNTFyZFJVb2FTVzhkc2pYRlpUZHN6dFNTRWNnRlVUR2thTXd3Z1phSHA0Ti1HN0RKbktCRmNtT2pBVHpmbkJuSXZZYzBaOWRxbTRXamN6MWFFN2ZzMnRMTi1LR1dFWTR5WGhJTTVNbHpjb3h5dlRWUGZzTlNTaWV6cHZLbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNR3ZLUlhQbG9kWmxwVzZZajFLUXVOQ1FJcC14MWN4aHVNemxTaWhvXzFkenVabUdUakkzX01lSG4ydnhuSXBoamM3UVFzeWRqb3VhUzVJNkRJby1HV0RTVnpsa01SY2JPS1NmalkzVnRuNmFmQ0hZMjRtQ04tdllvTFVLYmstMTl2NW5UZUJKci1TcVE0MlBPR2k0WVZuUUpxQ2d0cHB3MjF1cEpNVXVCREdheFoxM3J1X01KRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPbkt2WTBXUjNITEhxT1FsVi1KR2hONHNmcXZqMm1kX3JGU0lqTy1hNWRxdkplZ21Pa0x1b0Z6S1AxUVVNR1VLUW8xSzdzWjlyNEp2ZHBuQ0sxdWhLZGlEd3M4V1U5WGp3VWFHUURVWnhLRnU5NzNNRWVnNmNHSWRxNVptRVFYWDRXR0RZWUtwNUV3WTUyaXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز